      "correctAnswer": "16",
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "Parts = 3 + 5 = 8 → each part = 64 ÷ 8 = 8. Amounts: 24 and 40. Difference = 40 − 24 = 16.",
      "difficulty": "medium"
    },
    {
